WEBVTT

00:13:27.167 --> 00:13:30.559
There are some hard problems
that have to be dealt with:

00:13:30.583 --> 00:13:32.643
Al-Qaeda, ISIS --

00:13:32.667 --> 00:13:35.101
they remain dangerous threats.

00:13:35.125 --> 00:13:38.143
They must be found,
they must be destroyed.

00:13:38.167 --> 00:13:41.976
The question is, is it wise for the West,

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:45.226
which represents 12 percent
of the world's population --

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:47.184
yes, 12 percent --

00:13:47.208 --> 00:13:49.684
to fight these threats on its own

00:13:49.708 --> 00:13:53.893
or to fight with the remaining
88 percent of the world's population?

00:13:53.917 --> 00:13:56.268
And the logical and rational answer is

00:13:56.292 --> 00:13:59.643
that you should work
with the remaining 88 percent.

00:13:59.667 --> 00:14:00.976
Now where does one go